    "created_at": "2023-05-03T17:11:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-05-03T17:11:34Z",
    "body": "> Closest to that is probably the [origin private file system](https://developer.chrome.com/articles/origin-private-file-system/). It’s specified in the [File System Living Standard](https://fs.spec.whatwg.org/).\r\n\r\nThat should cover `app-storage:`! But it seems the article doesn't cover about the file size limit. Is there a permission prompt to ask the user to allow large storage files?",
