    "created_at": "2023-05-03T17:15:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-05-03T17:15:49Z",
    "body": "About `app:`:\r\n\r\n- The origin private file system can kind of achieve `app:` besides `app-storage:`.\r\n- The origin private file system can't access files that ship with a standalone app that is built in, like, say, Electron; so emulating `app:` with that API doesn't go well.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
