    "created_at": "2023-05-03T22:05:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-05-03T22:05:42Z",
    "body": "On browsers which support it, https://wicg.github.io/file-system-access/ allows you to read/write files on the local file system (without being subject to the browser's quota limits), but it's not exactly a 1:1 replacement since it's not possible to pre-load access to any specific files (see https://github.com/WICG/file-system-access/issues/235 for example)",
